  "description": "<p>Hey there! We're ReCandle Co., a San Diego-based eco-friendly candle brand on a mission to make sustainable living effortlessly stylish. As a small, female-owned business, we're shaking up the candle industry one refill at a time!</p>\r\n<p>We offer a thoughtful, refillable candle system featuring locally handcrafted ceramic vessels and 100% soy wax refills. Our candles use non-toxic fragrances, and are designed for easy refilling without any messy melting. Easily slide out the finished wax, and pop in a new refill!</p>\r\n<p>We offer competitive commission rates starting at $15 for each sale you generate. Payments are made via PayPal for all qualifying sales.</p>\r\n<p>By partnering with ReCandle Co., you're not just promoting great products - you're supporting a small, female-owned business and contributing to a more sustainable future. Plus, we plant a tree for every order!</p>\r\n<p>Join us in revolutionizing the candle industry and let's spread some eco-friendly light together!&nbsp;</p>",
